                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Ambiguous measurement uses one Ambiguity ID for ambiguous detections candidates. Ambiguous detections (all detection candidates for the same measurement) are shown by the same Ambiguity ID</L-2>
                      </DESC>
